{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.terms_2_6_higher_operations","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.terms_2_6_higher_operations","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.terms_2_6_higher_operations","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.terms_2_6_higher_operations","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L48-L64","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nTerms 2 (single-generator brane tower $\\sum \\Phi_q(|\\hat V_i|)$) and\n6 (jet-level prefix corrections) of the unified knot mass formula\n([unified knot mass](#thm:knot-mass-formula-unified)) are the two\nremaining open identifications in the spectral-sequence framework\n([$E_\\infty$ page identifications](#prop:e-infinity-page-identifications)).\nThis proposition sketches concrete avenues to close both via\n**higher operations** on the Hochschild cohomology of $H_n(R, q)$.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:terms-2-6-higher-operations","label":"prop:terms-2-6-higher-operations","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/terms-2-6-higher-operations.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.claim_term_6_jet_prefix_correction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.claim_term_6_jet_prefix_correction","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (term 6): jet-level prefix correction\nidentifies with the `E_∞^{5,*}` page via the Hochschild higher-\noperation `μ_6` (page index `5`, arity `6`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.hochschild_arity_term_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.hochschild_arity_term_6","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Hochschild higher-operation arity used for term 6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.target_page_term_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.target_page_term_6","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Page index targeted by term 6 (jet-level prefix correction\nidentification). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.claim_term_2_single_generator_brane_tower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.claim_term_2_single_generator_brane_tower","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (term 2): single-generator brane tower\nidentifies with the `E_∞^{1,*}` page via the binary Hochschild\nhigher-operation `μ_2` (page index `1`, arity `2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.hochschild_arity_term_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.hochschild_arity_term_2","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Hochschild higher-operation arity used for term 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.target_page_term_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.target_page_term_2","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Page index targeted by term 2 (single-generator brane tower\nidentification). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.HeckeAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.HeckeAlgebra","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L26-L26","doc":"The Hecke algebra `H_n(R, q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.Link","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.Link","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/terms_2_6_higher_operations.lean#L24-L24","doc":"The topological-link / knot type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Terms26HigherOperationsContext.CategoricalObj","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://git